 "summary": "Flat park, no buildings. Ground slab top y 0 (x -72..18, z 100..164), boundary walls z 164 / x 18. 8 benches (x -58 / -12 at z 139 / 153; with backs x -66 / -4 at z 140 / 154), 2 garden corners (2 m stone L-walls + 0.9 m planter), 2 shelters (x -59.7..-56.3 / -13.7..-10.3, z 149.5..152.5, roof 2.6-2.75 m), 4 raised planting beds on the lawns (1.17 m), 8 tree trunks (2.8 m). Routes: N-S paths x -70 / -35 / 0 (3.8 m), cross paths z 146 (3.2 m) and z 160 (3.8 m). Lawns had no collision.",
 "dressing_plan": "Park painting style on the old flat layout: lawns + paved paths as 1 cm patches, pines with layered crowns (2 sakura accents), wooden benches on the old bench colliders, lantern posts + bollard lamps (baked light), shrubs on the planters and lawn corners, treeline backdrop outside the boundary."
